Bags of holding have not been covered well in the Nethack Spoilers so far.
Maybe the new spoilers will elaborate on this topic, but for now, this is
what I think I know. Correct me if anything is wrong.

[SPOILER]

The most effective thing you can do with a bag of holding is curse it. DON'T
do this while it holds useful stuff cause after that, when you apply the bag,
random items will vanish. The neat thing about this is, that the weight of
the bag gets negative during that process, so put everything you don't need
into the bag and apply it until the stuff is gone.

   I don't know whether this is a bug or a feature, but it works with 3.0j
so it is probably a feature.

   There is a certain maximum amount of negative weight you can get with one
bag,but nothing prevents you from having more than one.

   You should also keep one uncursed/blessed bag of holding, 'cause with all
the stuff you are now able to carry, you'll soon fill all your 52 slots.

